# Optional. Without this, the app runs fully offline on bundled demo data.
# Get a free key at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api (v3 auth, "API Key").
#
# NEVER commit a real key in this file or anywhere else in the repo. For local
# development, copy this file to ".env.local" (already git-ignored) and put
# your real key there. For the deployed GitHub Pages build, add it as a
# repository secret named TMDB_API_KEY instead (see README) — the deploy
# workflow injects it as this same variable at build time.
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
